            "text": "List champion, challenger, and archived model versions for a pipeline. Each model includes its holdout_score, role, recipe_hash, is_preliminary flag, and agent_description. The active scoring model has role='champion'. Use the recipe_hash to detect when the champion has changed across training runs.",
